            </note>
            <note corresp="#d299-f2" n="2" xml:id="d299-f2-content">
                <p>Reference is to the memorandum of Dec. 1, <hi rendition="#italic">supra</hi>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d299-f3" n="3" xml:id="d299-f3-content">
                <p>Not found in Department of State or Foreign Operations Administration files.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d299-f4" n="4" xml:id="d299-f4-content">
                <p>No record of this meeting has been found in Department of State or Foreign
                    Operations Administration files.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d299-f5" n="5" xml:id="d299-f5-content">
                <p>For documentation on the Fifteenth Ministerial Meeting of the North Atlantic
                    Council, see <ref target="frus1952-54v05p1#pg_549">vol. <hi
                            rendition="#small-caps">v</hi>, Part 1, pp. 549</ref> ff.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d299-f6" n="6" xml:id="d299-f6-content">
                <p>For documentation on the “new capability” concept for NATO, see <ref
                        target="frus1952-54v05p1#pg_482"><hi rendition="#italic">ibid.</hi>, pp.
                        482</ref> ff.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d299-f7" n="7" xml:id="d299-f7-content">
                <p>No record of this meeting has been found in Department of State or Foreign
